  <div class="footer">
  <p>This budget represents the organizational finances of The Collaborative Advocate Foundation for the current fiscal year. TCAF is a startup nonprofit; no IRS Form 990 has been filed as the organization has not completed its first full fiscal year. This budget is provided in accordance with the Rare Impact Fund's LOI requirements as an alternative to Form 990.</p>
